      {
        "id": 92266,
        "name": "Envisioner",
        "username": "Envisioner",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/e/9de053/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2014-02-19T19:23:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Foote\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/foote/48/1877_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Foote:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Reread the thread please. I'm not trying to rehash pages of arguments here.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>The information has long since passed the point where it becomes a giant wall of lorem ipsum and my eyes glaze over.&nbsp; If you can't be bothered* with summarizing the consensus for me, that's perfectly fair, but you will have to accept the consequence of my remaining ignorant.&nbsp; If your conscience can bear that burden, more power to you.&nbsp;  <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/smiling_imp.png?v=12\" title=\":smiling_imp:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":smiling_imp:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li>I really wanted to say \"can't be arsed\" here because I think it sounds hilarious, but I wanted to be clear that I'm not picking a fight or anything.&nbsp; My casual use of profanity is probably not blameless in the number of needless conflicts I get into.</li>\n</ul>",
